# Verida Smart Contract Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Verida.

Verida is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a Web3 data, identity and application infrastructure security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Verida  
Audit type: Smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

## Public Audit Report

[02_Smart Contract Audit_Verida.pdf](./02_Smart%20Contract%20Audit_Verida.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed smart contract security work for Web3 data and application infrastructure.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s smart contract audit work connected to decentralized data infrastructure, identity related systems and Web3 application security.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
